  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0137" xml:lang="en">
        <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00447/" ed="1r" type="sheet"/>
        <div>
          <ab hand="#hand_gray_oegfl">
            <lb/>A<unclear>-</unclear>2
          </ab>
        </div>
        <div type="letter_message" hand="#hand_blue_auden">
          <opener>
            <dateline>
              <date>
                <lb/>3<hi rend="superscript">ten</hi> Juli
              </date>
            </dateline>
            <seg hand="#print_black_auden" xml:lang="de">
              <placeName>
                <address>
                  <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_2">3062 KIRCHSTETTEN
                  <lb/>BEZ. ST. PÖLTEN
                  <lb/>HINTERHOLZ 6
                  <lb/>N.-Ö., <foreign xml:lang="en">AUSTRIA</foreign></rs>
                </address>
              </placeName>
            </seg>
            <salute>
              <lb/>Dear <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_135">Miss Bronold</rs>:
            </salute>
          </opener>
          <p>
            <lb/>Have just receiv<unclear>ed</unclear> your letter after
            <lb/>a trip I ha<unclear>d</unclear> to make to <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_56">London</rs>
          </p>
          <p>
            <lb/>The <rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_235"><foreign xml:lang="de">Finanzamt</foreign> St Pölten</rs> <rs type="event" ref="#amp_event_id_45">demands
            <lb/>S 149,981 as Income Tax f<unclear>or</unclear> 1969</rs>.
            <lb/>I think th<unclear>is</unclear> absurdly high, but have said
            <lb/>I would pay it in three installments
            <lb/>over thre<unclear>e</unclear> years. If anyth<unclear>in</unclear>g <hi rend="underline" hand="#hand_blue_auden">ca<unclear>n</unclear></hi> be<unclear>-</unclear>
            <lb/>done, of course I would be pleased.
          </p>
          <p>
            <lb/>Could you ask <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_137">D<hi rend="superscript">r</hi> Kraus</rs> to get in touch
            <lb/>with me, since there a<unclear>re</unclear> one or two problems
            <lb/>I wi<unclear>s</unclear>h to d<unclear>i</unclear>scuss with him.
          </p>
          <closer>
            <salute>
              <lb/>Yours sinc<unclear>e</unclear>rely
            </salute>
            <signed>
              <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">W<unclear>.</unclear>H Auden</rs>
            </signed>
          </closer>
        </div>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00448/" ed="1v" type="sheet"/>
      </div>
      </div>
    </body>
